# 12. Recording availability is another issue

A meeting can finish at:

```text
10:00
```

but the recording might not immediately appear in Drive.

So this:

```python
find_recording_in_drive()
```

might return:

```text
No recording found
```

at 10:01,

while the recording appears at 10:10.

Your application currently treats:

```text
No recording found
```

as basically:

```text
No recording exists
```

Those are not necessarily the same thing.

We should eventually distinguish:

```text
Recording not available yet
```

from:

```text
Recording genuinely not found
```

